ays\\\",\\\"stat2l\\\":\\\"leave midway and pick up where you stopped\\\",\\\"stat3n\\\":\\\"Checkable notes\\\",\\\"stat3l\\\":\\\"every note traces back to your answer — no made-up scores\\\",\\\"stat4n\\\":\\\"Instant review\\\",\\\"stat4l\\\":\\\"per-question notes, only for you, showing where you stalled\\\",\\\"pathEyebrow\\\":\\\"How you practice\\\",\\\"pathH2\\\":\\\"Real experience → adaptive interview → reviewable growth\\\",\\\"path1Title\\\":\\\"Real experience\\\",\\\"path1Desc\\\":\\\"The resume and projects are practice material. Wording can change; the career cannot be invented.\\\",\\\"path2Title\\\":\\\"Adaptive interview\\\",\\\"path2Desc\\\":\\\"Text practice follows your answer. It is not a list you finish.\\\",\\\"path3Title\\\":\\\"Reviewable growth\\\",\\\"path3Desc\\\":\\\"Per-question notes are for you. You can see where you stalled.\\\",\\\"archEyebrow\\\":\\\"Load-bearing points\\\",\\\"archH2\\\":\\\"Built this way in preview.\\\",\\\"arch1Title\\\":\\\"Adaptive interviewer\\\",\\\"arch1Desc\\\":\\\"The system asks the next question from your last answer. It is not a recruiter using the product.\\\",\\\"arch2Title\\\":\\\"Progress can stay\\\",\\\"arch2Desc\\\":\\\"Progress is stored in the database, not the browser.\\\",\\\"arch3Title\\\":\\\"Local checks\\\",\\\"arch3Desc\\\":\\\"Every conclusion passes local checks before it reaches you — opening a page is not acceptance.\\\",\\\"arch4Title\\\":\\\"Scoring fences\\\",\\\"arch4Desc\\\":\\\"Notes are for review. They are not a capability certification.\\\",\\\"arch5Title\\\":\\\"Nothing lost\\\",\\\"arch5Desc\\\":\\\"Each practice step is written twice on purpose — progress and records always agree.\\\",\\\"arch6Title\\\":\\\"Scoped retrieval\\\",\\\"arch6Desc\\\":\\\"Questions and materials follow visibility.\\\",\\\"featEyebrow\\\":\\\"What you can practice\\\",\\\"featH2\\\":\\\"Sort the story, practice, read the notes, then look again.\\\",\\\"cap1Mark\\\":\\\"R\\\",\\\"cap1Title\\